      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FR\n1. User can search books\n2. User should be able to buy books\n3. Book seller can inform the book availability\n\nNFR\n- High Availabity\n- consistency > availability\n- 200 milion active users\n- 2 miliom transactions\n- 200 milion / 24 / 3600 ~ 2k rps",
      "fontSize": 10.841914404894766,
      "baseFontSize": null,
